PURPOSE of kcov/merge
Description: Merge kcov/finalize data
Author:  Jing Yang <jinyang@redhat.com>

Input parameter:
	REQUIRED: JOBS="J:1234 J:5678 J:0123 J:7890" : Job ids to merge lcov result, separated by white space
	OPTIONAL: USE_INFO : use .info files from /kernel/kcov/finalize tasks instead of downloading entire html tgzs.
	OPTIONAL: GENCASELIST=NO : Whether to generated case list in index.html -> view descriptions. 
		  By default, it is YES
	KCOV_SRC_RPM: url of kernel-gcov-$VR.gcov.$arch.rpm
	XY: short distro version, like 75 76 77 80 81

How to run merge on local:
	just run /path/kcov/merge/runtest.sh like:
	  sudo XY=$X$Y /path/kcov/merge/runtest.sh J:411519 J:410094 J:410085 ...
	#or
	  sudo KCOV_SRC_RPM=$url /path/kcov/merge/runtest.sh J:411519 J:410094 J:410085 ...

How to run merge by beaker job:

	if use bkr-client-improved(https://github.com/tcler/bkr-client-improved):
	  runtest RHEL-$X.$Y --task=/kernel/kcov/merge --param=JOBS="J:411519 J:410094 J:410085 ..."
	  runtest 7 -param=XY=$X$Y --task=/kernel/kcov/merge --param=JOBS="J:411519 J:410094 J:410085 ..."
	  runtest 7 -param=KCOV_SRC_RPM=$url --task=/kernel/kcov/merge --param=JOBS="J:411519 J:410094 J:410085 ..."
